<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech Spolana cuts losses in 1996.</title>
<headline>Czech Spolana cuts losses in 1996.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary unaudited results for year ending December 31, 1996:</p>
<p>(in millions of crowns)</p>
<p> Net profit/loss	0.565 loss  vs    1,190.658 loss</p>
<p> Assets	    10,200.0	   vs   10,619.499</p>
<p> Basic capital    4,100.0	   vs    4,479.266</p>
<p>Note. Full company name is Spolana Neratovice a.s., a chemicals and plastics maker. Results are supplied by the Prague Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 420-2-2423-0003</p>
</text>
